@startuml
title CV-JD Analysis Flow - Core Platform Service

autonumber

actor Frontend

participant "AnalysisController" as Controller
participant "AnalysisService" as Service
participant "CVRepository" as CVRepo
participant "JDRepository" as JDRepo
participant "AnalysisRepository" as AnalysisRepo
participant "CoreMessageProducer" as Producer
queue "RabbitMQ" as Rabbit
participant "AI Engine Service" as AI
participant "CoreMessageConsumer" as Consumer
participant "Dashboard Service" as Dashboard

== 1. Create CV-JD Analysis ==

Frontend -> Controller: POST /api/core/analyses\nCreateAnalysisRequest(cvId, jdId)

Controller -> Service: createAnalysis(request)

Service -> CVRepo: findById(cvId)
CVRepo --> Service: CV

Service -> JDRepo: findById(jdId)
JDRepo --> Service: JD

== 2. Validate CV & JD ==

Service -> Service: Validate CV exists
Service -> Service: Validate JD exists

Service -> Service: Check CV.status == COMPLETED
Service -> Service: Check JD.status == COMPLETED

alt CV/JD not found
    Service --> Controller: Throw ResourceNotFoundException
    Controller --> Frontend: HTTP 404
else CV/JD not preprocessing completed
    Service --> Controller: Throw InvalidStateException
    Controller --> Frontend: HTTP 400
else CV & JD valid
    == 3. Create Analysis ==

    Service -> Service: Create Analysis entity
    Service -> Service: status = PENDING
    Service -> Service: createdAt = now()

    Service -> AnalysisRepo: save(analysis)
    AnalysisRepo --> Service: Analysis(PENDING)

    == 4. Send Analysis Request to AI Engine ==

    Service -> Service: Create CVAnalysisRequest\n(analysisId, cvId, jdId)

    Service -> Producer: sendAnalysisRequest(request)

    Producer -> Rabbit: Publish CV_ANALYSIS_REQUEST

    Rabbit -> AI: CVAnalysisRequest

    == 5. Return Initial Response ==

    Service -> Service: Map Analysis -> AnalysisResponse

    Service --> Controller: AnalysisResponse(PENDING)
    Controller --> Frontend: HTTP 200\nAnalysisResponse

end

== 6. AI Engine Processing ==

AI -> AI: Load CV structured data
AI -> AI: Load JD structured data
AI -> AI: Calculate semantic similarity
AI -> AI: Calculate skill matching
AI -> AI: Detect skill gaps
AI -> AI: Calculate matchScore
AI -> AI: Calculate semanticScore
AI -> AI: Calculate skillScore

AI -> Rabbit: Publish CVAnalysisResult

note right of Rabbit
CVAnalysisResult:
- analysisId
- success
- matchScore
- semanticScore
- skillScore
- skillGaps
- errorMessage
end note

== 7. Core Receives Analysis Result ==

Rabbit -> Consumer: CVAnalysisResult

Consumer -> Service: handleAnalysisCompleted(result)

Service -> AnalysisRepo: findById(analysisId)
AnalysisRepo --> Service: Analysis

alt Analysis not found
    Service -> Service: Throw ResourceNotFoundException

else AI processing failed

    Service -> Service: status = FAILED
    Service -> Service: Set error state

    Service -> AnalysisRepo: save(analysis)
    AnalysisRepo --> Service: Analysis(FAILED)

else AI processing successful

    == 8. Update Analysis Result ==

    Service -> Service: Set matchScore
    Service -> Service: Set semanticScore
    Service -> Service: Set skillScore

    == 9. Save Skill Gaps ==

    Service -> Service: Clear existing skillGaps

    loop For each SkillGapResult
        Service -> Service: Create SkillGap
        Service -> Service: Set skillName
        Service -> Service: Set type
        Service -> Service: Set matchStatus
        Service -> Service: Set score
        Service -> Service: Set evidence
        Service -> Service: Add SkillGap to Analysis
    end

    == 10. Complete Analysis ==

    Service -> Service: status = COMPLETED
    Service -> Service: completedAt = now()

    Service -> AnalysisRepo: save(analysis)
    AnalysisRepo --> Service: Analysis(COMPLETED)

    == 11. Publish Standardized Result ==

    Service -> Service: Map Analysis -> AnalysisResponse

    Service -> Producer: sendAnalysisResult(AnalysisResponse)

    Producer -> Rabbit: Publish CV_ANALYSIS_RESULT

    Rabbit -> Dashboard: AnalysisResponse

end

@enduml
